{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"85ea9de70ddadd35a6569f75f355c45c737932d561e30ec6e9df5b2293d4de58","ja":"次の挑戦は……","zh":"下一个挑战是……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2b71948f188bd3950d770fd2dc46d48689e5149e02ac6cbc9f3e328592c23917","ja":"とある大学の敷地内……","zh":"某所大学的校园内……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"298c069b45c94893ec508cc42cfa9b5c78a8bd7343ccb17ea3aa13d931d8e66a","ja":"いやー、盛り上がってたね！　ここの同人サークル！\nまさに、アタシたちの劇そのまんまって感じ！","zh":"哎呀～，真热闹呢！这边的同人社团！\n简直就像是我们演的剧原原本本呈现出来了一样！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e2bea113f2a0b6a3069d12f5062dbb6d88253a4f6cb28844dc7a1a8b69be82e9","ja":"そうですね！　ちょうど次の大型同人誌即売会に\n向けて、作業の追い込みをされてた所ですし！","zh":"是啊！她刚好正为了下一届大型同人志展销会，\n处于最后的赶稿冲刺阶段呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"34d56b656f382bb6c290f99de86b37f7c75dde3bdf79636c17028d2ea8d53330","ja":"修羅場なのに、皆さん楽しそうで……。\n勉強になりました。","zh":"明明身处修罗场，大家却好像很开心的样子……\n真是让我学到了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"abb07c60b568a89f4d8c736a2b7960132ee64b742e03348998ab4f9150e7417e","ja":"うん！　『フレッシュクリエイト』の2回目\n『同人サークルを体験しよう！』……。","zh":"嗯！　《Fresh Create》的第2期\n“去体验同人社团吧！”……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"77b79403449a82eacb4ab356c95c6e0ac0836fd53b1794651b0c8f978ebd2990","ja":"今回も大成功まちがいなしだね！","zh":"这次也肯定能大获成功呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"fc1019c635c4377187fb9ea5d4c60dc2888a26f33aa0f8f387f549f0d06340e8","ja":"はい。今日の体験を、\nしっかり記事にしましょう。","zh":"好的。把今天的体验，\n好好写成报道吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c3c6710bf463f5f4092bc041617d0acae94d3e27f08be264ad05e65dcfb116b5","ja":"それでは、そろそろ帰る準備を。\n衣装を着替えて……。","zh":"那么，差不多该准备回去了。\n先把演出服换下来……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3ea8c82107847daf5e871058f6813c555da8e32e3c63bb3b39f81eeaf3f2841a","ja":"うん。でも、せっかく大学に来たのに、\nもう帰っちゃうのは、ちょっともったいないかも？","zh":"嗯。不过，难得来了一趟大学，\n就这么回去的话，是不是有点可惜呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"1dc2f740ca37321c0fbdd00597ee5aa862a66e7a2cf4abcad1ddf797c701be79","ja":"そうですね……。\nあまり来る機会もありませんし。","zh":"也是呢……\n平时也不怎么有机会来。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"7b0b5e293f9696de9533cf8ca96c56106128c82bc0a7f7c0d41939eda8835ec8","ja":"ありさも、できれば大学を見学したいです！\n実は行きたい場所がありまして……。","zh":"亚利沙也想尽可能参观一下大学！\n其实我有想去的地方……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"08bc38f8dc44581577399d98857d5c1d98cab6148520b74cb03fc97616175be5","ja":"それなら～……今から始めちゃおっか？\nぱんぱかぱ～ん♪　『いきなり！大学ツアー♪』","zh":"既然这样～……那就现在开始吧？\n锵锵锵～♪　“突击！大学之旅♪”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"bdad2e5406178cc9ba7a62000caa7c50925726143d74293ae38529cb274ca48f","ja":"ふおお～～っ！\nぜひ、ぜひお願いします、麗花ちゃん！！","zh":"哇喔～～！\n请务必、务必拜托你了，丽花！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1026.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"58311fed8e09385fa9a9699037ffa3f9b003c7fb3268ca2551584ecf0d526985","ja":"ふふっ♪\nじゃあ、もうちょっと見学させてもらいましょ！","zh":"呵呵♪\n那就再多参观一会儿吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
